{"id":"n61952-2-9","stage":5,"title":"뿜어내다 · 发出","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61952-2-9-1","ko":"한여름에는 태양이 뿜어내는 햇살이 정말 너무 뜨거워.","zh":"盛夏时，太阳散发出的阳光实在热得让人难以忍受。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한여름에는","meaning":"盛夏，酷暑","explanation":"한여름：盛夏，酷暑；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"한여름","audio":"/audio/1f82eb48400eef9703cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85583","senseId":"1","lemma":"한여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한여름에는","audio":"/audio/8860e04f5724c8031296.mp3"}},{"text":"태양이","meaning":"太阳，希望","explanation":"태양：太阳，希望；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"태양","audio":"/audio/3cc1f372d2086037d72b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72179","senseId":"1","lemma":"태양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"태양이","audio":"/audio/130964a71cea8cee3c25.mp3"}},{"text":"뿜어내는","meaning":"发出，散出","explanation":"뿜어내다：发出，散出；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"뿜어내다","audio":"/audio/607f8a14d530785c7fad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61952","senseId":"2","lemma":"뿜어내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뿜어내는","audio":"/audio/71eb8b704a1e55aec721.mp3"}},{"text":"햇살이","meaning":"阳光，日光","explanation":"햇살：阳光，日光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"햇살","audio":"/audio/1436beae29371a857708.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72477","senseId":"1","lemma":"햇살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"햇살이","audio":"/audio/605e827c1e51028d5363.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId"